[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_MINE]
Timbucktu Field Trip

[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_MINE_desc]
Even before getting the approval, greedy speculative miners have already started mining and processing Timbucktu Crystals... This is worth paying attention to.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_MINE]
廷马克图考察

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_MINE_desc]
